{
  "_comment": [
    "Measured on rbe-west, the lane's own remote executors (instance oss), on",
    "2026-10-09: two `bazel test //cmd/bd:bd_proxied_test",
    "--config=doltserver-proxied --nocache_test_results` runs, one against the",
    "then-committed 44-shard block and one against a 20-shard repack, both",
    "with the shared harness's database-scoped users",
    "(cmd/bd/proxied_shared_harness_test.go), so every discovered test ran",
    "exactly once per run, with the lane's -test.parallel=4 and GOMAXPROCS=4.",
    "Both passed.",
    "",
    "Each value is a top-level test's serial-equivalent cost: the sum of the",
    "<testcase time> of every leaf test under it (a subtest with no subtests of",
    "its own; the test itself when it has none), each leaf averaged over the",
    "two runs. It is NOT <testsuite time>: for a t.Parallel test that",
    "attribute runs from the test's first RUN line to its last PASS line, so it",
    "also counts the time the test sat paused behind its shard's other tests.",
    "Leaves, not direct subtests, because a parallel group's own <testcase",
    "time> is 0.",
    "",
    "Nearly all of a test's cost is `bd init --proxied-server` against the",
    "shard's dolt sql-server, ~one per subtest. Before the scoped users each",
    "init also paid for every database already on the server (Dolt walks every",
    "database the session can see for each of the ~220 INFORMATION_SCHEMA",
    "queries in the migration chain), so a test's cost depended on how many",
    "projects its shard had created before it; the previous capture totalled",
    "19,618 cost-seconds over the same tests, this one 6,345.",
    "",
    "A shard's remote wall time came out at about 0.33x its packed cost (four",
    "subtests run at once): the 20-shard repack, packed to ~335 per shard, ran",
    "median 113s, max 136s.",
    "",
    "`seconds_per_init_fallback` is the sum of all costs over the sum of all",
    "inits (discover_inits_cost()), used only for a test with no entry yet.",
    "",
    "Regenerate the same way: fresh remote runs of the target, then sum each",
    "top-level test's leaf <testcase time>s from every shard's",
    "bazel-testlogs/cmd/bd/bd_proxied_test/shard_*/test.xml."
  ],
